{"fps": 30, "frames": 1689, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 115, "text": "One forgotten stock beat your whole managed portfolio.", "words": [{"w": "One", "f": 0, "e": 7}, {"w": "forgotten", "f": 9, "e": 23}, {"w": "stock", "f": 25, "e": 37}, {"w": "beat", "f": 41, "e": 46}, {"w": "your", "f": 48, "e": 55}, {"w": "whole", "f": 57, "e": 64}, {"w": "managed", "f": 66, "e": 75}, {"w": "portfolio.", "f": 78, "e": 101}]}, {"a": 115, "b": 227, "text": "Nineteen fifties. You manage a wealthy woman's money.", "words": [{"w": "Nineteen", "f": 117, "e": 128}, {"w": "fifties.", "f": 130, "e": 146}, {"w": "You", "f": 165, "e": 167}, {"w": "manage", "f": 169, "e": 176}, {"w": "a", "f": 178, "e": 181}, {"w": "wealthy", "f": 183, "e": 192}, {"w": "woman's", "f": 194, "e": 203}, {"w": "money.", "f": 206, "e": 215}]}, {"a": 227, "b": 361, "text": "For about ten years, you buy, sell, trim, rebalance.", "words": [{"w": "For", "f": 229, "e": 231}, {"w": "about", "f": 233, "e": 240}, {"w": "ten", "f": 242, "e": 249}, {"w": "years,", "f": 251, "e": 265}, {"w": "you", "f": 267, "e": 270}, {"w": "buy,", "f": 272, "e": 288}, {"w": "sell,", "f": 290, "e": 306}, {"w": "trim,", "f": 312, "e": 325}, {"w": "rebalance.", "f": 327, "e": 345}]}, {"a": 361, "b": 485, "text": "Then her husband dies, and his stocks land on your desk.", "words": [{"w": "Then", "f": 363, "e": 373}, {"w": "her", "f": 379, "e": 384}, {"w": "husband", "f": 386, "e": 395}, {"w": "dies,", "f": 397, "e": 414}, {"w": "and", "f": 416, "e": 418}, {"w": "his", "f": 421, "e": 425}, {"w": "stocks", "f": 431, "e": 437}, {"w": "land", "f": 439, "e": 446}, {"w": "on", "f": 448, "e": 450}, {"w": "your", "f": 453, "e": 457}, {"w": "desk.", "f": 459, "e": 473}]}, {"a": 485, "b": 563, "text": "He'd been copying you. Half of you.", "words": [{"w": "He'd", "f": 487, "e": 491}, {"w": "been", "f": 494, "e": 496}, {"w": "copying", "f": 498, "e": 512}, {"w": "you.", "f": 514, "e": 519}, {"w": "Half", "f": 533, "e": 539}, {"w": "of", "f": 542, "e": 544}, {"w": "you.", "f": 546, "e": 557}]}, {"a": 563, "b": 668, "text": "Whenever you said buy, he put in about five thousand dollars,", "words": [{"w": "Whenever", "f": 565, "e": 574}, {"w": "you", "f": 576, "e": 578}, {"w": "said", "f": 581, "e": 585}, {"w": "buy,", "f": 590, "e": 606}, {"w": "he", "f": 608, "e": 610}, {"w": "put", "f": 613, "e": 615}, {"w": "in", "f": 617, "e": 619}, {"w": "about", "f": 623, "e": 626}, {"w": "five", "f": 631, "e": 635}, {"w": "thousand", "f": 638, "e": 647}, {"w": "dollars,", "f": 649, "e": 667}]}, {"a": 668, "b": 768, "text": "dropped the certificate in a safe deposit box, and forgot it.", "words": [{"w": "dropped", "f": 670, "e": 677}, {"w": "the", "f": 678, "e": 679}, {"w": "certificate", "f": 687, "e": 695}, {"w": "in", "f": 696, "e": 697}, {"w": "a", "f": 699, "e": 702}, {"w": "safe", "f": 704, "e": 706}, {"w": "deposit", "f": 709, "e": 720}, {"w": "box,", "f": 722, "e": 736}, {"w": "and", "f": 738, "e": 741}, {"w": "forgot", "f": 745, "e": 750}, {"w": "it.", "f": 752, "e": 757}]}, {"a": 768, "b": 848, "text": "Whenever you said sell? Nothing.", "words": [{"w": "Whenever", "f": 770, "e": 777}, {"w": "you", "f": 779, "e": 782}, {"w": "said", "f": 784, "e": 789}, {"w": "sell?", "f": 793, "e": 811}, {"w": "Nothing.", "f": 821, "e": 841}]}, {"a": 848, "b": 924, "text": "So how did your lazy copycat do?", "words": [{"w": "So", "f": 850, "e": 857}, {"w": "how", "f": 859, "e": 864}, {"w": "did", "f": 866, "e": 869}, {"w": "your", "f": 870, "e": 871}, {"w": "lazy", "f": 873, "e": 882}, {"w": "copycat", "f": 885, "e": 901}, {"w": "do?", "f": 904, "e": 910}]}, {"a": 924, "b": 1079, "text": "Some shrank below two thousand dollars. Several grew past a hundred thousand.", "words": [{"w": "Some", "f": 926, "e": 935}, {"w": "shrank", "f": 939, "e": 946}, {"w": "below", "f": 949, "e": 958}, {"w": "two", "f": 962, "e": 965}, {"w": "thousand", "f": 967, "e": 976}, {"w": "dollars.", "f": 978, "e": 992}, {"w": "Several", "f": 1006, "e": 1017}, {"w": "grew", "f": 1019, "e": 1024}, {"w": "past", "f": 1026, "e": 1035}, {"w": "a", "f": 1038, "e": 1040}, {"w": "hundred", "f": 1042, "e": 1049}, {"w": "thousand.", "f": 1054, "e": 1079}]}, {"a": 1079, "b": 1180, "text": "You see, it's the Old West coffee can under the mattress.", "words": [{"w": "You", "f": 1081, "e": 1083}, {"w": "see,", "f": 1087, "e": 1097}, {"w": "it's", "f": 1099, "e": 1104}, {"w": "the", "f": 1105, "e": 1106}, {"w": "Old", "f": 1109, "e": 1113}, {"w": "West", "f": 1115, "e": 1122}, {"w": "coffee", "f": 1125, "e": 1134}, {"w": "can", "f": 1136, "e": 1143}, {"w": "under", "f": 1145, "e": 1147}, {"w": "the", "f": 1150, "e": 1151}, {"w": "mattress.", "f": 1152, "e": 1175}]}, {"a": 1180, "b": 1324, "text": "A dud can only lose what's inside. A winner has no ceiling.", "words": [{"w": "A", "f": 1182, "e": 1184}, {"w": "dud", "f": 1186, "e": 1195}, {"w": "can", "f": 1198, "e": 1202}, {"w": "only", "f": 1205, "e": 1211}, {"w": "lose", "f": 1214, "e": 1221}, {"w": "what's", "f": 1223, "e": 1229}, {"w": "inside.", "f": 1230, "e": 1246}, {"w": "A", "f": 1257, "e": 1259}, {"w": "winner", "f": 1262, "e": 1271}, {"w": "has", "f": 1278, "e": 1285}, {"w": "no", "f": 1289, "e": 1294}, {"w": "ceiling.", "f": 1296, "e": 1310}]}, {"a": 1324, "b": 1472, "text": "One small bet in a company called Haloid grew past eight hundred thousand dollars.", "words": [{"w": "One", "f": 1326, "e": 1330}, {"w": "small", "f": 1335, "e": 1342}, {"w": "bet", "f": 1344, "e": 1349}, {"w": "in", "f": 1351, "e": 1352}, {"w": "a", "f": 1353, "e": 1355}, {"w": "company", "f": 1360, "e": 1365}, {"w": "called", "f": 1367, "e": 1374}, {"w": "Haloid", "f": 1376, "e": 1392}, {"w": "grew", "f": 1394, "e": 1399}, {"w": "past", "f": 1401, "e": 1410}, {"w": "eight", "f": 1413, "e": 1417}, {"w": "hundred", "f": 1422, "e": 1429}, {"w": "thousand", "f": 1435, "e": 1445}, {"w": "dollars.", "f": 1447, "e": 1467}]}, {"a": 1472, "b": 1689, "text": "Haloid became Xerox. That one stock outgrew his wife's wh